{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_NOCMDLINE__"}}----
Intrinsic define (macro value) set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_NOCMDLINE__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Returns non-zero (-1) when ##-z nocmdline## disables source ###cmdline## directives, or zero (0) otherwise. When enabled, the compiler ignores those directives and uses only options passed to **fbc**.

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.4

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerOptz|Compiler Option: -z]]
	- ##[[KeyPgPpcmdline|#cmdline]]##

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Intrinsic Defines"}}
